  <!-- ─── Six Operational Stages ───────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeading
        title="Six Operational Stages"
        subtitle="Six connected stages take a team from the first observation to a verified outcome and a record worth keeping. Repeat is not a seventh stage: it returns the team to Understand when conditions change or the problem comes back."
        centered={true}
      />

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-4">

        <!-- Stage 1: Understand — azul escuro (igual ao card azul escuro do Print 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-primary-700 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">01</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Understand</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700 mb-2">What's happening, and what needs attention?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            State what was observed separately from any diagnosis: the asset, location, time, operating mode, possible service impact, and who has authority to respond.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2: Assess — azul médio/ciano (igual ao card azul médio do Print 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-primary-500 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-600 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">02</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Assess</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-600 mb-2">What do we know, and what still needs checking?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Bring together the evidence needed for the next decision, such as SCADA trends, alarms, maintenance records, and field observations, and note how reliable each item is.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 3: Prioritize — teal/verde-azulado (igual ao card teal do Print 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-secondary-500 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-600 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">03</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Prioritize</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-600 mb-2">What matters most right now?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Decide what comes first based on safety, water quality, service continuity, and urgency, using the utility's own risk and escalation rules.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 4: Respond — teal (igual ao card teal do Print 1, mesma cor que Prioritize) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-secondary-500 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-600 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">04</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Respond</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-600 mb-2">What's the next safe, authorized action?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Carry out the response within approved procedures and assigned authority. Record who authorized it, who performed it, and the result expected.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 5: Verify — verde médio (igual ao card verde médio do Print 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-accent-400 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-accent-100 text-accent-600 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">05</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Verify</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-600 mb-2">Did it actually work?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Compare what was observed after the response with the result expected. A sent command or a cleared alarm is not proof that the operating condition was restored.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 6: Learn — verde escuro (igual ao card verde escuro do Print 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-secondary-600 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-secondary-100 text-secondary-700 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mr-3 flex-shrink-0">06</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Learn</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-700 mb-2">What does the next shift need to know?</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Keep a short, asset-linked record that states three things separately: whether service was stabilized, whether the cause was identified, and whether the correction was verified. Open items get an owner.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Areas of Application ─────────────────────────────── -->
  
<!-- ─── Areas of Application ─── -->
<section
  class="py-20"
  style="--foto-altura: 160px; --foto-zoom: 1;"
